        "补充预付状态、候补可服务时段与项目、轮转顺序、通知和30分钟回执时间；明确去重键与快照时点。"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "source_key": "d9",
        "quote": "提供历史爽约统计、当日待执行预约、候补名单与触达约束"
      },
      "id": "appointment-scheduler-zh:knowledge:booking_config",
      "normalized_kind": "template",
      "customer_facts_supplied": false,
      "content_acceptance": "pending_employee_production"
    },
    {
